{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12140","headline":"淮上别范大 · 钱起","name":"淮上别范大","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悲风陨凉叶，送归怨南楚。\n穷年将别离，寸晷申宴语。\n长淮流不尽，征櫂忽复举。\n碧落半愁云，黄鹤时顾侣。\n游宦且未达，前途各修阻。\n分袂一相嗟，良辰更何许。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}